          content: `## Describing People

### Appearance adjectives
**tall / short** — висок / низок
**slim / fit / athletic** — витка / во форма / спортска
**handsome / beautiful** — убав / убава
**dark / fair** — темнокос / светлокос (hair)

### Character adjectives
**friendly / outgoing** — пријателска / отворена
**smart / bright** — паметен / бистар
**funny / quiet** — смешен / тивок
**stylish / fashionable** — стилска / модна

### Clothing
**jacket, shirt, T-shirt, jeans, trousers, skirt, blouse, dress, shoes, coat, glasses**

---

## Comparatives

| Type | Rule | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Short (1 syllable) | + **-er** | tall → **taller**, short → **shorter** |
| Ends in -y | **-y → -ier** | friendly → **friendlier** |
| Long (2+ syllables) | **more** + adj | fashionable → **more fashionable** |

**Structure:** A is **[comparative]** than B
- *Sarah is **taller than** me.*
- *He is **friendlier than** his brother.*

### Possessive pronouns
my → **mine** | your → **yours** | his → **his** | her → **hers** | our → **ours** | their → **theirs**`,
