          title: 'Places in Town & Giving Directions',
          content: `## Places in Town

**neighborhood** — населба | **town / village** — град / село
**cinema** — кино | **museum** — музеј | **zoo** — зоолошка
**bank** — банка | **restaurant** — ресторан | **hospital** — болница
**supermarket** — супермаркет | **post office** — пошта
**police station** — полиција | **baker's** — пекара | **butcher's** — месарница

## Giving Directions

| Phrase | Значење |
|---|---|
| Go **straight** (ahead) | Оди право |
| Turn **left / right** | Сврти лево / десно |
| It's **opposite** the bank | Наспроти банката |
| It's **next to** the museum | До музејот |
| It's **behind** the school | Зад училиштето |
| It's **on the corner** | На аголот |

**Example dialogue:**
*A: Excuse me, where is the post office?*
*B: Go straight down the street and turn left. It's next to the supermarket.*

## Superlatives

| Type | Rule | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Short (1 syllable) | **the** + adj + **-est** | old → **the oldest** |
| Ends in -y | **the** + adj + **-iest** | friendly → **the friendliest** |
| Long (2+ syllables) | **the most** + adj | beautiful → **the most beautiful** |

*Lake Ohrid is **the oldest** lake in Europe.*
*The River Vardar is **the longest** river in our country.*`,
