          id: 'eng5-3-2',
          title: 'Professions & Past Simple TO BE',
          content: `## Professions

**teacher** — наставник | **doctor / nurse** — доктор / медицинска сестра
**firefighter** — пожарникар | **police officer** — полицаец
**baker** — пекар | **farmer** — земјоделец | **driver** — возач
**waiter / waitress** — келнер / келнерка | **artist** — уметник

**Collocations (verb + noun):**
- **fight crime** — борба против криминал (police officer)
- **deliver letters** — доставување писма (postman)
- **drive a bus** — возење автобус (bus driver)
- **teach students** — предавање на ученици (teacher)

**I want to be a teacher.** *(want + to + infinitive)*
**When I grow up, I want to be a firefighter.**

---

## Past Simple — TO BE

| | Positive | Negative |
|---|---|---|
| I / He / She / It | **was** | wasn't |
| You / We / They | **were** | weren't |

**Question:** Was there a cinema? / Were there any shops?

**Time adverbs:** yesterday, last night, two years ago, last summer

*A: Was there a bank here ten years ago?*
*B: No, there wasn't. There was only a small post office.*

## Quantity expressions
**some** (позитивни) | **any** (прашални/негативни) | **a lot of** | **a few** | **a couple of**`,
