          content: `## Health Vocabulary

**stomachache** — болка во стомак | **headache** — главоболка
**toothache** — заболка | **fever / high temperature** — треска
**cold** — настинка | **stomach flu** — стомачна вирус

*Ann has a horrible toothache.*
*Emma feels sick. She has a fever.*

## Food & Meals

**breakfast / lunch / dinner** — појадок / ручек / вечера
**healthy food** — здрава храна | **vegetables** — зеленчук
**main course / starter** — главно јадење / предјадење

**Food containers:** a bottle of water, a can of juice, a jar of jam, a carton of milk, a kilo of apples, a packet of biscuits

**Cutlery:** knife, fork, spoon, plate, cup, glass, bowl, chopsticks

---

## Modal Verb CAN / CAN'T

Used for: **ability** (умеење) and **asking permission** (барање дозвола)

| | Positive | Negative |
|---|---|---|
| All persons | **can** + verb | **can't** + verb |

**Ability:** *She can ride a bike. / My mum can't drive a car.*
**Permission:** *Can I open the window? / Can I please go outside?*

## Would like + to infinitive (учтиво барање / желба)
*I **would like** to order a salad, please.*
*We **would like** a bowl of soup.*
*(= I want, но поучтиво)*`,
